coverage/

# Reports from optional tooling (mutation testing writes here).
reports/

# Agent worktrees and local session state. CLAUDE.md itself is committed.
.claude/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.log
